    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A BRUTAL precision platformer where decapitation is just the beginning!</h2><br>Haiki is a diamond-hard platformer that rewards skilful play and punishes errors MERCILESSLY. Dive head-first into four worlds of colour-switching, laser-dodging, lightning-fast action.<br>You control Haiki's severed head, on an epic journey to defeat the slash-happy Baron Nohead. Leap from wall-to-wall, across chasms, over spikes... into oblivion. You\u2019ll need precision jumps and keen reactions to survive the 80 hand-crafted levels standing between Haiki and victory. <br><br>Die, die and die again until your reflexes are sharp enough to face the headless Baron and get your body back.<br><br>Or lose your head forever.<br><br>Want to get ahead? Get a hat! Collect dapper, dashing and dandy hats on your journey up from the gutter. How do the hats help Haiki on his quest? <br><br>They don't. AT ALL. <br><br>They're just hats.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced, intuitive, limb-free platforming<br></li><li>80 levels, from EASY to PURE HELL<br></li><li>A story that makes Shakespeare look like an idiot<br></li><li>Speedrun mode for the truly hardcore<br></li><li>Collectible hats for the truly awesome</li></ul>",
